      "id": "L479-S01",
      "text": "小光很會聊天，而且人緣好。",
      "spokenText": "小光很會聊天而且人緣好",
      "displayLines": [
        "小光很會",
        "聊天，",
        "而且人緣好。"
      ],
      "focusChar": "聊",
      "imageNotes": "學校下課，固定小光和主角女孩、固定小月在長椅旁聊天。小光自然比手勢分享事情，女孩和小月專注聽、笑著接話；另一名 generic 同學開心走來加入。是有來有往的聊天，不是小光站著演講、其他人排坐聽課。小光必須使用 public/assets/reference/lesson-cast/xiaoguang.webp：圓眼鏡、整齊短黑髮、白短袖襯衫、深藍背心、卡其短褲、白襪、棕鞋、深綠書包。小月必須使用 public/assets/reference/lesson-cast/xiaoyue.webp：長柔卷深栗髮、月亮髮夾、薰衣草 cardigan、淡奶油上衣、青綠百褶裙、白襪、紫鞋。named cast 不可換成 generic 或主角女孩。",
      "imagePrompt": "Square 1:1 richly detailed warm modern children picture-book illustration in refined traditional pencil-and-watercolor, closely matching the full L058 set as STYLE ONLY and the refined L115-S01/S02, L118-S02, L119-S01 and L128-S03 examples. Use fine textured pencil linework, layered transparent pigment, modeled expressive faces, natural child and adult proportions, warm Taiwan daylight, detailed but clean environments, phone-readable composition and generous safe margins. Recurring protagonist girl: preschool child with short dark-brown bob, pink hair clip, pink cardigan over cream top, navy skirt and pink shoes. Recurring mother: chin-length dark hair, cream blouse and blue jeans. Recurring father: short dark hair, blue button shirt over a light top and khaki trousers. Do not copy any person identity from L058. No photorealism, anime, 3D render, flat cartoon, coarse wash, readable text, letters, digits, labels, logos, route numbers, brands, captions, speech bubbles or watermarks. School recess near a bench. Fixed Xiaoguang sits or stands naturally with the recurring protagonist girl and fixed Xiaoyue in a small conversational group. Xiaoguang gestures naturally while sharing something; both girls face him, listen and smile, and a fourth generic classmate approaches happily to join. Everyone participates in a relaxed back-and-forth conversation. Do not stage Xiaoguang as a lecturer, performer or teacher, and do not line the others up as an audience. Xiaoguang exactly follows xiaoguang.webp: round glasses, tidy short black hair, white short-sleeve shirt, navy vest, khaki shorts, white socks, brown shoes and dark-green schoolbag. Xiaoyue exactly follows xiaoyue.webp: long softly curled dark-chestnut hair, crescent moon hair clip, lavender cardigan, cream top, teal pleated skirt, white socks and purple shoes. Keep all named children visually distinct.",
